+Known initial renderer codes:
+
+```text
+tab_crash
+```
+
+Renderer/tab crashes are reported through the existing `non_fatal` event type,
+not a new backend schema. The app sends:
+
+```json
+{
+  "schema": 1,
+  "type": "browser_express_event",
+  "event_type": "non_fatal",
+  "product": "BrowserExpress_Android",
+  "version": "0.0.276",
+  "upload_transport": "browser_express_json",
+  "privacy": "no_url_no_title_no_account_no_device_id",
+  "component": "renderer",
+  "code": "tab_crash",
+  "severity": "error"
+}
+```
+
+Use this for dashboards that distinguish full browser-process crashes from
+tab renderer crashes where the app remains alive.
+
